{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9cdbd60bcf3ad83c50c2677de0f2b1a39bfaad0f4f25df86f2022220c77ce3e9","ja":"はぁ…………。","zh":"唉…………","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"549ab1b5b87c586e08a3a5185b3541d6b08c420d5e848dfae3610564a6e2c2fc","ja":"どうしたの、ひなたちゃん？\nすっごく大きなため息がでちゃってるよ。","zh":"你怎么了，日向？\n叹了那么大一口气呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b97e11a279650d6787b00ff5c7f27bda72b7503cb42aa1f0b06bcb05d97b8a6f","ja":"実は、朝からなまら運が悪くてねぇ……。さっきも\nお腹が鳴っちゃいそうで、我慢してたんだぁ。","zh":"其实，我从早上开始运气就特别差呢……刚才也\n肚子差点叫出声，一直在硬憋着呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b4c4f3085f351dc900234b2304e21b4d590f22a540d47bb3a1798d5e8382885d","ja":"あと、自動販売機にお金が入らなかったり、\n改札の扉が閉まったり……。","zh":"还有，投不进自动售货机的投币口啦、\n检票口的闸门关上啦……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"50dd7742a6ac3f88139da43ec64feef514c8bbb769bbff47eb8b4be484ecc969","ja":"次の取材のお仕事も、\nなにかあったらどうしよう、って……。","zh":"下一次的采访工作，\n要是又出什么事该怎么办，就总忍不住这么想……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8eeca6408ecbb02fe33f3329a517cc51d5459b12ceccdb1495beeaeb5c181da6","ja":"ミキ、その気持ちわかるの！\nミキも今日はずっと運がなくて……。","zh":"美希懂那种心情！\n美希今天也是一直运气很差……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f369f7ec9e257f435cfd1c32104c0a079356f19db54262184256e4684a75ec9d","ja":"目覚ましが止まってるし、電車で寝てたら\n降りる駅を間違えちゃうし……最悪ってカンジなの！","zh":"闹钟停了，在电车上睡着了\n还下错了车站……简直倒霉透顶了啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1d42877f4e0c5fb86652c8a3bae1f9011e1a58014f8491a8d89fd61d34f717db","ja":"……あれっ？\nでも、美希さんのは運なのかな……？","zh":"……咦？\n不过，美希的情况算是运气好吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c1ef159c32c1531238de034faa967ff44b4f7f4d04c55a6c93e9d23ee30327de","ja":"でもこれはチャンスって思うな。\nだって、マイナスとマイナスでプラスっていうでしょ。","zh":"不过我觉得这是个机会呢。\n毕竟不是常说，负负得正嘛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f0df28e9d8179c867753ecbcd1d32ea63864091de0438de588652f3e800b70ba","ja":"だから、ひなたとミキの運の悪さが一緒になったら、\nきっと今回の取材は大成功なの！","zh":"所以，要是日向和美希的倒霉凑到了一起，\n这次的采访就一定会大获成功的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3cb02aa34dd551953d5156adc5c12ef6cf166294df393f52d8e96a10ff3759c8","ja":"なるほど……。美希さん、ありがとねぇ。\nあたし、ちょっくら自信が湧いてきたよぉ！","zh":"原来如此……。美希，谢谢你呀。\n我稍微涌起一点自信了哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3684605896f2a616c5bb54a6365c4f7034c29a7741a165c4fb9ada4806270348","ja":"よかったっ！\nそれじゃあ、次のお仕事も頑張りましょ～！","zh":"太好啦！\n那么，下一份工作也要加油哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1335.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4206079987b8aa4a836d20b6d89f3a200252e18c1fe774751b07e5835f2851a0","ja":"プラスがいっぱいの楽しい取材に\nしちゃおう～、なの～♪","zh":"把这次采访做成充满正能量的\n快乐采访吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
